harness  a coding agent in your terminal                                                  
                                                                                          
  Welcome! Connect an AI provider to start. It takes about a minute.                      
                                                                                          
    1  Pick a provider                                                                    
       OpenAI, Anthropic, or any OpenAI-compatible service                                
    2  Paste your API key                                                                 
       kept in your user folder only, readable by you alone                               
    3  Choose a model                                                                     
       harness asks the provider which ones your key can use                              
                                                                                          
  ▸ Press enter to start, or type /connect                                                
                                                                                          
  Already have a key in your environment?                                                 
    export OPENAI_API_KEY=…  or  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=…  then run harness again.             
  Running a local model (Ollama, llama.cpp)?                                              
    add it under providers: in /home/u/.har/config.yml — no key needed.                   
                                                                                          
                                                                                          
                                                                                          
                                                                                          
                                                                                          
                                                                                          
                                                                                          
                                                                                          
                                                                                          
                                                                                          
                                                                                          
 no provider · not connected  ctrl+o expands tools · ctrl+c quits                         
│ Message (enter sends, alt+enter or ctrl+j adds a line)                                  
